---
import * as icons from "@grave/animated-icons/astro";
import { receiptIcons } from "../../../../helpers/receipt-icons";
const sizes = [14, 16, 24, 28];
---

<html lang="en">
  <head><meta charset="utf-8" /><title>Receipt recipe comparisons</title></head>
  <body>
    <h1>Receipt recipe comparisons</h1>
    <p>The reference runs the original Lucide Animated React components from revision 4662fff2b60fdcf4751b32013606756caf7c4c26. Their class utility import points to a local equivalent. ReceiptSwissFranc dimensions are normalized to the requested size. React is confined to this comparison page.</p>
    <p>Hover a row or use its Replay button to animate both versions together. Play all starts every sample. Stop all returns them to rest. Seek pauses both versions at the selected time in the current playback.</p>
    <p>ReceiptText uses one cancellable timeline for the upstream hidden and visible phases. The numerical comparison checks each phase separately; interrupted React callbacks can start a later phase after stop. The interrupted currency return comparison checks geometry, path length and path offset. It excludes opacity because native seeking does not update the React Motion value used to start the return. Adapter lifecycle tests check opacity continuity and cleanup.</p>
    <button type="button" id="play">Play all</button>
    <button type="button" id="stop">Stop all</button>
    <label>Playback time in milliseconds <input id="time" type="number" value="200" min="0" max="3000" step="50" /></label>
    <button type="button" id="seek">Seek and pause</button>
    {receiptIcons.map(icon => {
      const Component = icons[icon.name];
      return <section>
        <h2>{icon.name}</h2>
        <p><a href={`https://github.com/pqoqubbw/icons/blob/4662fff2b60fdcf4751b32013606756caf7c4c26/icons/${icon.slug}.tsx`}>Pinned upstream recipe</a> · <a href={`/${icon.slug}/`}>Manual controls and lifecycle</a></p>
        <table>
          <thead><tr><th>Size</th><th>Astro adapter</th><th>Upstream React component</th><th>Playback</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>{sizes.map(size => <tr data-icon={icon.slug} data-size={size}>
            <th scope="row">{size} px</th>
            <td data-adapter><Component size={size} controlled /></td>
            <td><div data-reference data-name={icon.name} data-size={size}></div></td>
            <td><button type="button" data-replay aria-label={`Replay ${icon.name} at ${size} pixels`}>Replay</button></td>
          </tr>)}</tbody>
        </table>
      </section>;
    })}
  </body>
</html>

<script>
  import "../receipts-reference";
</script>
